          "text": "All non-spending invocations fail.",
          "formal": {
            "language": "ual",
            "source": "\n  ∀ (minimum : Int) (ctx : ScriptContext), ((¬ (∃ (ref : _) (d : _), ctx.scriptContextScriptInfo = SpendingScript ref d))) → (\n    isUnsuccessful (fixtures__vesting minimum (toLedgerData ctx))\n\n)"
